          "preguntaId": "9535484c-d2da-4c82-9f2e-94442c658cef",
          "enunciado": "A conversation between two friends discussing new technology in their city.\n\n19\nWhat is the main feature of the new city app mentioned in the conversation?\nA) It offers discounted travel tickets.\nB) It provides real-time public transport updates.\nC) It allows booking taxis directly.\nD) It tracks users’ daily steps.\n\n20\nHow does the app help with crowded buses during rush hour?\nA) It suggests alternative, less crowded routes.\nB) It sends notifications about overcrowding fines.\nC) It limits the number of passengers boarding buses.\nD) It offers live video feeds of bus interiors.\n\n21\nWhat is special about the new street lighting in the city?\nA) It changes colors based on weather conditions.\nB) It adjusts brightness when someone is nearby to save energy.\nC) It is controlled remotely by users through the app.\nD) It has built-in cameras for traffic monitoring.\n\n22\nHow does the city’s initiative help residents avoid pollution?\nA) By providing free masks in high pollution areas.\nB) By sending alerts about pollution levels through the app.\nC) By closing off streets with poor air quality.\nD) By encouraging residents to work from home.\n\n23\nWhat concern do some people have about the new technologies?\nA) That they will be too expensive to maintain.\nB) That the data collected may invade their privacy.\nC) That the technology will replace public transport workers.\nD) That it will increase electricity consumption.",
